  <h2 id="next-step">What to do next</h2>

  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
    <p>
      Pick one route from the table and run it through the four questions.
    </p>
    <p>
      Then finish one small project in that route, say it in two minutes, and show it to three people who hire for the role.
    </p>
  </div>

  <p>
    A BBA is strongest when it feeds a high-value skill portfolio, because that is what moves you toward higher income and earlier financial freedom. You can start with the free
    <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/assessments/">career and skill assessments</a>
    if you are not sure which route fits you.
  </p>

